      "writtenOn": "2026-11-19T14:38:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done in patch set 2. `check_export` refuses a syntax export that holds another unit\u0027s macro, or compiled syntax under a key other than its own. Re-exporting another library\u0027s macro through a binding still works. `a_library_cannot_define_another_librarys_macros` and `a_library_cannot_supply_another_librarys_compiled_syntax` cover it.",
      "parentUuid": "d2299aa5_2ca2da91",
      "revId": "060ee05cbaf46b808397560b4cf19185d2be80b2",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
